---
/**
 * 隐私政策（AdSense 审核必查项）。
 *
 * 只陈述本静态站实际发生的事：无账号、无表单、无服务端日志收集，
 * 只有 Google Analytics 统计与 Google AdSense 第三方广告 cookie。
 */
import Shell from "../layouts/Shell.astro";
import { t, type Locale } from "../lib/i18n";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === "zh";
const l = (en: string, cn: string) => (zh ? cn : en);
---

<Shell locale={locale} title={l("Privacy policy", "隐私政策")} description={l(
  "How this site handles analytics, advertising cookies, and your data.",
  "本站如何处理访问统计、广告 Cookie 与你的数据。",
)}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose policy">
      <h1>{l("Privacy policy", "隐私政策")}</h1>
      <p class="muted">{l("Last updated: 15 November 2026", "最后更新：2026 年 11 月 15 日")}</p>

      <h2>{l("What this site is", "本站是什么")}</h2>
      <p>{l(
        "This is a static, public website that mirrors open-source release notes and publishes original analysis of release cadence. There are no user accounts, no sign-in, no comment forms and no payment flows. We do not ask you to submit personal information.",
        "本站是一个公开的静态网站，收录开源项目的版本发布说明，并发布基于发布节奏的原创分析。站内没有账号体系、登录、评论表单或支付流程，也不会要求你提交个人信息。",
      )}</p>

      <h2>{l("Information we collect", "我们收集的信息")}</h2>
      <p>{l(
        "We do not run our own tracking database. Like most websites, our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (IP address, user agent, requested URL) for security and delivery purposes. We use Google Analytics to understand aggregate, non-identifying usage such as which pages are visited.",
        "本站不运营自有追踪数据库。与多数网站一样，托管服务商可能为安全与内容分发保留标准服务器日志（IP 地址、浏览器标识、请求地址）。我们使用 Google Analytics 了解汇总的、非识别性的访问情况，例如哪些页面被访问。",
      )}</p>

      <h2>{l("Cookies and third-party advertising", "Cookie 与第三方广告")}</h2>
      <p>{l(
        "We use Google AdSense to display a small number of advertisements at the end of article pages. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies (including the DART cookie) to serve ads based on a user's visits to this and other websites. These cookies allow Google and its partners to show ads that may be relevant to you.",
        "我们使用 Google AdSense 在文章页末尾展示少量广告。Google 作为第三方供应商，会使用 Cookie（包括 DART Cookie）依据用户对本网站及其他网站的访问记录投放广告，以便向你展示可能更相关的广告内容。",
      )}</p>
      <p>{l(
        "You can opt out of personalised advertising at Google Ads Settings, and learn more about how Google uses data on its partner sites at Google's privacy policy page. You can also disable or delete cookies in your browser settings; doing so will not prevent you from reading any content on this site.",
        "你可以在 Google 广告设置中停用个性化广告，也可以在 Google 隐私权政策页面了解其如何在合作网站上使用数据。你同样可以在浏览器设置中禁用或删除 Cookie；这不会影响你阅读本站任何内容。",
      )}</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Google — {l("How ads use data", "广告如何使用数据")}</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>{l(
        "Third-party ad servers and networks may use their own technologies and are governed by their own privacy policies. We have no access to, and no control over, these cookies.",
        "第三方广告服务器与广告联盟可能使用各自的技术，并受各自的隐私政策约束。我们无法访问、也无法控制这些 Cookie。",
      )}</p>

      <h2>{l("Data sharing", "数据共享")}</h2>
      <p>{l(
        "We do not sell, rent or trade personal data, because we do not collect any. Content on this site is drawn from public upstream repositories; release notes remain the property of their respective projects.",
        "我们不收集个人数据，因此不会出售、出租或交易个人数据。本站内容来自公开的上游代码仓库，发布说明的版权归各自项目所有。",
      )}</p>

      <h2>{l("Children's privacy", "儿童隐私")}</h2>
      <p>{l(
        "This site is a technical reference and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.",
        "本站是技术资料站点，不面向 13 岁以下儿童，也不会有意收集儿童信息。",
      )}</p>

      <h2>{l("Changes and contact", "政策变更与联系方式")}</h2>
      <p>{l(
        "We may update this policy when the site's features change. If you have questions about this policy, or about how the site handles data, you can reach us by email.",
        "当站点功能发生变化时，我们可能更新本政策。对本政策或站点数据处理方式有疑问，可通过邮件联系我们。",
      )}</p>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:contact@stags.cn">contact@stags.cn</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Shell>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding-top: var(--s12);
    padding-bottom: var(--s20);
  }
  .policy h2 {
    margin-top: var(--s9);
  }
  .policy a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
